Final Conclusion
This project evolved from a simple exercise into a Metadata-Driven Incremental ETL Framework in Microsoft Fabric capable of processing multiple tables through a single reusable pipeline.
The design is scalable and can be extended to dozens or even hundreds of tables simply by adding metadata entries, without modifying the pipeline itself.

